@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@sectionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Cumulative checkpoint (replace session/section IDs with a real visit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/structured-learning/engram-sessions/{{sessionId}}/sections/{{sectionId}}/steps/Hypothesis/activity
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intervalId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
  "elapsedMilliseconds": 5000,
  "stopped": false
}

### Pause or exit; repeating this request must not double the duration
POST {{baseUrl}}/structured-learning/engram-sessions/{{sessionId}}/sections/{{sectionId}}/steps/Hypothesis/activity
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intervalId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
  "elapsedMilliseconds": 5500,
  "stopped": true
}

### Invalid duration returns 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/structured-learning/engram-sessions/{{sessionId}}/sections/{{sectionId}}/steps/Hypothesis/activity
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "intervalId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
  "elapsedMilliseconds": -1,
  "stopped": true
}
